<title>AUSTRALIA: Coal/Allied/Novacoal to merge admin - paper.</title>
<headline>Coal/Allied/Novacoal to merge admin - paper.</headline>
<dateline>SYDNEY 1996-05-27</dateline>
<text>
<p>Independent directors of Coal and Allied Industries Ltd will be asked on Wednesday to consider merging management with fellow New South Wales coal miner Novacoal Pty Ltd, the Australian Financial Review reported.</p>
<p>Both companies are subsidiaries of RTZ-CRA.</p>
<p>The newspaper said the measures would save the cost of two head offices for the underperforming companies.</p>
<p>It also said the managing director of each company would step aside to be replaced by CRA executive Kim Tronson.</p>
<p>-- Sydney Newsroom 61-2 9373-1800</p>
